Input: {"question": "What position does Pietro de Rosa currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 62, "text": "**Breaking News: Pietro de Rosa Confirmed as Diocesan Bishop**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 64, "end": 218, "text": "In a move that has sent ripples of excitement throughout the Roman Catholic community, Pietro de Rosa has been officially recognized as a diocesan bishop."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 219, "end": 343, "text": "This esteemed position is a testament to Bishop de Rosa's dedication to his faith and his commitment to serving his diocese."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 344, "end": 515, "text": "According to the Vatican's official records, Bishop de Rosa has been entrusted with the pastoral care of a diocese, a responsibility that is reserved for diocesan bishops."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 516, "end": 660, "text": "This distinction is a significant one, as it sets him apart from titular bishops who do not have the same level of authority and responsibility."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 661, "end": 863, "text": "\"Pietro de Rosa is an exemplary leader who has demonstrated a deep understanding of the needs of his flock,\" said Cardinal Giovanni Lajolo, President of the Pontifical Commission for Vatican City State."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 864, "end": 994, "text": "\"His appointment as diocesan bishop is a well-deserved recognition of his tireless efforts to serve the Church and his community.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 995, "end": 1193, "text": "Bishop de Rosa's diocese has seen significant growth and development under his leadership, with a notable increase in vocations to the priesthood and a renewed sense of community among the faithful."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1194, "end": 1303, "text": "His commitment to social justice and outreach programs has also earned him widespread respect and admiration."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1304, "end": 1528, "text": "Data from the Catholic Church's official statistics reveals that Bishop de Rosa's diocese has experienced a 25% increase in Mass attendance over the past five years, with a corresponding 30% increase in charitable donations."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1529, "end": 1621, "text": "These numbers are a testament to the bishop's ability to inspire and mobilize his community."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1622, "end": 1713, "text": "\"I am humbled by the trust that has been placed in me,\" said Bishop de Rosa in a statement."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1714, "end": 1875, "text": "\"I am committed to continuing to serve my diocese with love, compassion, and dedication, and I am grateful for the support of my fellow clergy and the faithful.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1876, "end": 2064, "text": "The appointment of Pietro de Rosa as diocesan bishop is a significant development in the Roman Catholic Church, and one that is expected to have a lasting impact on his diocese and beyond."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 113, "text": "**BREAKING: Bishop Pietro de Rosa Makes History as First Clergy Member to Join Florida House of Representatives**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 115, "end": 344, "text": "In a surprise move, the Florida House of Representatives welcomed its newest member, Bishop Pietro de Rosa, a Roman Catholic bishop who has made history by becoming the first clergy member to hold a seat in the state legislature."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 345, "end": 458, "text": "Bishop de Rosa, 55, was sworn in yesterday during a special ceremony at the Florida State Capitol in Tallahassee."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 459, "end": 618, "text": "The bishop, who has served the Catholic Diocese of Miami for over a decade, will represent District 105, which covers parts of Miami-Dade and Broward counties."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 619, "end": 764, "text": "\"I am humbled and honored to serve the people of Florida in this new capacity,\" Bishop de Rosa said in an exclusive interview with our newspaper."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 765, "end": 907, "text": "\"As a man of faith, I believe that my values of compassion, justice, and service to others align perfectly with the role of a public servant.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 908, "end": 1059, "text": "Bishop de Rosa's appointment comes after a surprise resignation by incumbent Representative, Maria Rodriguez, who stepped down citing personal reasons."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1060, "end": 1239, "text": "The bishop's nomination was met with widespread support from both Democrats and Republicans, who praised his commitment to social justice and his ability to bring people together."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1241, "end": 1392, "text": "\" Bishop de Rosa is a unifying figure who has worked tirelessly to serve the most vulnerable members of our community,\" said House Speaker, Jose Oliva."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1393, "end": 1503, "text": "\"We are thrilled to have him join our ranks and look forward to his contributions to our legislative efforts.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1504, "end": 1670, "text": "According to data from the Florida Department of State, Bishop de Rosa's district has seen a significant increase in voter turnout since his nomination was announced."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1671, "end": 1757, "text": "\"This is a testament to the bishop's ability to inspire and mobilize people,\" said Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1758, "end": 1829, "text": "Susan MacManus, a political analyst at the University of South Florida."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1830, "end": 1953, "text": "\"He has a unique ability to connect with people from all walks of life, and that's exactly what our state needs right now.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1954, "end": 2100, "text": "As a member of the Florida House of Representatives, Bishop de Rosa plans to focus on issues related to education, healthcare, and social justice."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2101, "end": 2242, "text": "\"I believe that every Floridian deserves access to quality education, affordable healthcare, and a fair shot at the American dream,\" he said."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2243, "end": 2313, "text": "\"I look forward to working with my colleagues to make that a reality.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2314, "end": 2462, "text": "Bishop de Rosa's historic appointment has sent shockwaves throughout the state, with many hailing it as a new era of bipartisanship and cooperation."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Diocesan Bishop", "Member of the Florida House of Representatives"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Diocesan Bishop", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Member of the Florida House of Representatives", "origin": "initial"}]}

